	(text "\n- uMMF Altera MAX CPLD\n- 65C02 CPU.\n- Video uses DPRAM for 80 col or extended modes.\n- Character ROM size increased.\n- TTL Serial for Bluetooth/WiFi\n- Does not implement MODEM\n- Does not implement Battery backup\n- The keyboard uses an IDC connector that matches the companion\n  MX keyboard pcb, but also has headers for ROW, COL, MOD groups.\n- The keyboard is for the REV1 (Bil's prototype) firmware.\n- Internal headers for ports\n- LCD firmware will need to be patched to support VDC.\n- The original LCD panel is not available so we will\n  use an RGBI output to a modern VGA/HDMI panel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.605 396.875 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d92bc81a-cab1-4a1a-9d75-265341390522")
	)
